    "file": "blocks/layout-row.liquid",
    "individual_findings": "Individually reviewed all row controls and three complete column presets. Native tag:null plus one explicit root editor attribute makes the actual row a direct builder child. Saved mobile classes remain while a resolved mobile attribute handles inherited versus explicit stack/scroll/grid; scoped selector specificity and resets preserve row ownership against host styles. Scrollable rows are named keyboard regions; tag allowlist, box sizing and long-content bounds added. All three insertion presets explicitly use their configured spacing; merchant inheritance control remains functional. Child admission and all preset child trees preserved exactly.",
